{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rotten Forgotten</strong>: An intense co-op farming experience.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and embark on a agricultural journey in Rotten Forgotten, a charming <strong>cooperative</strong> <strong>farming</strong> game for <strong>1-4 players</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate a variety of crops, tend to your  farm animals, and race against time to fulfill deliveries. With a perfect blend of strategy, teamwork, and lighthearted fun, Rotten Forgotten is perfect for <strong>playing</strong> <strong>with</strong> <strong>friends</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/ffab723ca82613099d50c4d0c09ae6ba.poster.avif?t=1763761196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/ffab723ca82613099d50c4d0c09ae6ba.webm?t=1763761196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/ffab723ca82613099d50c4d0c09ae6ba.mp4?t=1763761196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging <strong>co-op gameplay</strong> for solo farmers or groups of up to four players. Play with <strong>keyboard</strong> and/or <strong>controllers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging <strong>time management</strong> as you juggle crop cycles and animal care.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plant!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/3fd81caf501d50d7776e033550381ff5.poster.avif?t=1763761196\" 